OL,3,APoundland's founder offers to invest in
OL,4,Afirm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland's founder has said he would
OL,7,Finvest in the firm and a government
OL,8,Fminister said she would meet the firm's
OL,9,Fboard amid its administration fears.
OL,11,FSteve Smith, who set-up the
OL,12,FWalsall-based business, said he had
OL,13,Fattempted to contact owners Gordon
OL,14,FBrothers having been "really surprised"
OL,15,Fto learn about them filing for
OL,16,Fadministration when sales were up 11%
OL,17,Fon last year.
